---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import UniversityFooter from '../components/UniversityFooter.astro';
import { ShieldCheck, Lock, Mail, ArrowLeft } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Student Privacy Policy | UOS Entrepreneurship Society"
  description="How the UOS Entrepreneurship Society collects and protects student data."
>
  <Navbar client:load currentPath="/privacy" />

  <main class="flex-grow py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 mb-8"
    >
      <ArrowLeft class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
      <span>Back to Home</span>
    </a>

    <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <ShieldCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" />
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase text-slate-500 tracking-wider">
          Student Data Policy
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Privacy & Data Transparency
      </h1>

      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        The <strong>UOS Entrepreneurship Society</strong> is a student-run chapter at the University of Sahiwal. We respect your privacy and follow strict data integrity practices.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">1. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          When you submit the membership application or register for an event, we collect: your Full Name, Academic Department, Current Semester, Email Address, WhatsApp Number, and stated learning goals.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base pt-2">2. How We Use It</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Your information is used strictly to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
          <li>Deliver workshop reminders and campus venue announcements.</li>
          <li>Send the private WhatsApp community invite link.</li>
          <li>Verify enrollment eligibility for campus computing labs and hackathons.</li>
          <li>Match you with relevant mentors and hackathon project teams.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base pt-2">3. No Commercial Sharing or Spam</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We will never sell, rent, or trade your contact information to third-party commercial entities, marketing agencies, or spam lists. Your details are accessible only by the authorized student executive committee.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base pt-2">4. Questions & Removal</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          If you wish to have your details removed from our membership roster, simply email us at <a href="mailto:ashiriftikharofficial@gmail.com" class="text-blue-900 underline font-mono">ashiriftikharofficial@gmail.com</a> and your record will be deleted within 24 hours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <UniversityFooter />
</Layout>
